OL,3,GNEWSAConcern about 999 process before
OL,4,Ameningitis death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has raised concerns about
OL,7,Femergency call handling after the death
OL,8,Fof a teenager from meningitis.
OL,10,FOliver Shelley died in July 2024 aged
OL,11,F17 from meningococcal septicaemia. His
OL,12,Fparents had rushed him to East Surrey
OL,13,FHospital in Redhill as an ambulance was
OL,14,Fnot dispatched after their 999 call.
OL,16,FSurrey assistant coroner Dr Karen
OL,17,FHenderson wrote, after an inquest in
OL,18,FFebruary, of concern about the lack of
OL,19,Fa sepsis pathway on the computer system
OL,20,Fassisting call handlers.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
